    "text": {
     "en": "Stand on the soil next to a plant, with your elders' permission. Look at its colour.\nPick up a little soil. Is it dry, damp, rough, smooth, hard or grainy? Did you find leaves, small stones or insects?\nSmell the soil and remember it.\nBirds make nests on trees or in hollows. Squirrels hide in hollows. Ants build nests with leaves.\nEarthworms and insects live in the soil.\nDifferent animals have different homes and food."
    }
